{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:97219","published":"2026-11-13T06:06:59.212490Z","modified":"2026-11-13T06:30:03.494134294Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-27951"],"summary":"Moderate: freerdp security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"FreeRDP is a free implementation of the Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP), released under the Apache license. The xfreerdp client can connect to RDP servers such as Microsoft Windows machines, xrdp, and VirtualBox.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* freerdp: FreeRDP: Denial of Service via endless blocking loop in Stream_EnsureCapacity (CVE-2026-27951)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update freerdp to the latest upstream stable release (JIRA:Rocky Linux-80426)\n\n* FreeRDP does not create context for hostnames longer than 31 characters (JIRA:Rocky Linux-143809)\n\n* SSL warnings under FIPS (JIRA:Rocky Linux-140202)\n\n* [RFE] Add RDP Smart Card Redirection Support (MS?RDPESC) to Enable Remote (Virtualized) SmartCard?Based PKINIT Authentication (JIRA:Rocky Linux-171999)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nAdditional Changes:\n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the Rocky Linux 10 Release Notes linked from the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"freerdp-libs-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/freerdp-libs-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2:3.28.0-4.el10_3"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:97219.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libwinpr-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/libwinpr-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2:3.2